---
title: "syncLegionAddresses (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_read_registry: caller invokes syncLegionAddresses()
    q_read_registry --> q_update: read updated addresses from addressRegistry
    q_update --> q_emit: legionBouncer = registry.bouncer, legionSigner = registry.signer, legionFeeRecipient = registry.feeRecipient
    q_emit --> [*]: emit LegionAddressesSynced()

    note right of q_read_registry
        INV-001: Addresses are pulled from central AddressRegistry contract
        INV-002: Updates legionBouncer, legionSigner, and fee recipient addresses
        INV-003: No access control restriction specified (may be callable by anyone)
    end note
